The '''Gullwing Wreckage''' is a site of a crashed zeppelin from [[Booty Bay]] that was on a routine cargo delivery when their helmsman, [[Helmsman Verix|Verix]], changed course to take a shortcut over [[Balor]] ostensibly to save fuel, but in reality to plunder the treasures from its ruins. The zeppelin was struck down by the thunderstorms that plague the island, leaving the crew stranded.

