{{Book||content=
Blessed are you, <name>, child of the Earth. The ancestors whisper your name in my ears with a joy that cannot easily be expressed. As such, I have sent word for you to meet me as soon as possible. We have much to discuss, for I am told you have made it your goal to worship the Three Celestial Siblings.

As you gather wit and wisdom here in the Red Cloud Mesa, your potential will surely reveal itself. Curiosity stirs in my mind. I wonder whether you will remain a disciplined devotee of all three, or find either An’she, Mu’sha, or Lo’sho closer to your heart and dedicate yourself to one above the others.
